# Refurbished Linux - core system.
# Only what the machine needs to boot, connect and stay healthy.
linux-image-amd64
live-boot
live-config
live-config-systemd
systemd
systemd-sysv
systemd-zram-generator
udev
dbus
# The polkit daemon. Only the client libraries were installed before, so every
# privileged D-Bus action was refused: NetworkManager answered the "connect to
# this Wi-Fi network" request with 'Not authorized to control networking'
# whatever the password, and udisks2 could not mount a drive. The default policy
# asks for an administrator password, so this image also ships a rule that lets
# the desktop account (group netdev) do those things without a prompt.
polkitd
sudo
network-manager
# Wi-Fi scanning and WPA/WPA2/WPA3 association. NetworkManager calls
# wpa_supplicant for the actual association; without it every scan comes back
# empty and "no networks found" is the only possible result.
wpasupplicant
iw
bluez
rfkill
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
# ALSA applications (including most native games) reach PipeWire through this.
pipewire-alsa
# Per-machine mixer profiles (UCM): without them many laptop codecs come up
# with the wrong output selected, or muted.
alsa-ucm-conf
alsa-utils
wireplumber
libspa-0.2-bluetooth
wireless-regdb
ca-certificates
curl
apt
dpkg
locales
tzdata
console-setup
keyboard-configuration
nano
less
btop
initramfs-tools
